# Design stack

| Need | Library | Notes |
|------|---------|-------|
| Editable PowerPoint | **PPTXGenJS** | Real `.pptx` for clients |
| Demo / motion video | **Remotion** | React → MP4; skill `remotion-best-practices` |
| Carousel PNG | **Satori** + **Resvg** | HTML/CSS → SVG → PNG |
| Design tokens / layout | **Tailwind CSS** | Spacing, type scale |
| UI components | **shadcn/ui** | Cards, pricing, testimonials in decks |
| Charts | **Recharts** or **Tremor** | Metrics, investor slides |
| Scroll motion (web) | **GSAP** | `gsap-framer-scroll-animation` skill |
| Visual audit | **impeccable** | Polish pass |

Full reference: [docs/DESIGN_STACK.md](../../docs/DESIGN_STACK.md)

Do not substitute Google Slides API when user asked for a **downloadable PPTX** — use PPTXGenJS.
